<title>USA: Deltic Timber Corp Q4 shr rises to $0.23.</title>
<headline>Deltic Timber Corp Q4 shr rises to $0.23.</headline>
<dateline>EL DORADO, Ark. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOURTH QUARTER			    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $22,036,000	18,666,000</p>
<p> Net income			    2,882,000	   777,000</p>
<p> Net income per Common share/a	   .23		 .06</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding/a   12,800,343	12,800,343</p>
<p>YEAR</p>
<p> Net sales			    86,498,000	80,662,000</p>
<p> Net income			   13,163,000	10,016,000</p>
<p> Net income per Common share/a	  1.03		 .78</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding/a   12,800,343	12,800,343</p>
<p>NOTE: Company was previously a unit of Murphy Oil Co. It was spun off to shareholders on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>1996 year includes a $700,000 gain from the sale of 3,200 acres of Arkansas farmland.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
